 "title": "Protein Annotation Methods and Tools",
 "summary": "This cluster is about various methods and tools used for protein annotation, including gene prediction and protein function prediction. AUGUSTUS and AUGUSTUS+ are gene prediction tools that use EST and h, and have predictions for human chromosome 22. AnnoPRO is a method that uses ProMAP and ProSIM, and has been compared to DeepGOPlus, NetGO3, and PFmulDL. The performance of some methods has improved or declined in protein function annotation, with AnnoPRO and PFmulDL showing improved performance and DeepGOPlus and NetGO3 showing declined performance. The cluster also includes protein sequences, which are used by ProMAP and ProSIM, and have data in the GO database and UniProt knowledgebase.",
